      "text": "王明，你们什么时候开学？",
      "reading": "Wáng Míng, nǐmen shénme shíhou kāixué?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "b",
      "text": "三月一号开学。",
      "reading": "Sān yuè yī hào kāixué."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "a",
      "text": "开学以前，你准备什么？",
      "reading": "Kāixué yǐqián, nǐ zhǔnbèi shénme?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "b",
      "text": "我开始准备英语考试。",
      "reading": "Wǒ kāishǐ zhǔnbèi Yīngyǔ kǎoshì."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "a",
      "text": "你真认真！",
      "reading": "Nǐ zhēn rènzhēn!"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "b",
      "text": "对，我想认真学习！",
      "reading": "Duì, wǒ xiǎng rènzhēn xuéxí!"
